: "cat_3f373f3146_part29.json"}, {"id": 132142, "title": "明眸", "category": "古装仙侠", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261023-1/d92c7589ce27506cd1172ce7f27f3461.jpg", "year": "2025", "area": "大陆", "actor": "姜贞羽,王佳璇,杨淇源,陈洁怡,应振南,杨茜雅", "director": "孙嘉阳", "content": "<p>　　北晋将军之女李知安（姜贞羽 饰），被曾经最爱之人药瞎了眼睛，并遭其背叛，折辱一生，最终惨死。一朝重生后，李知安在阴差阳错下恢复了视力，她决心装盲蛰伏在前世的爱人身边以报仇雪恨。在南梁世子朱怀瑾（王佳璇 饰）的帮助下，二人共同携手，拨乱反正。最终李知安大仇得报，也在和朱怀瑾的相处过程中感受到了彼此情意，收获了真正的爱情。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202610/22/Mck29mQXy695/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202505/26/8EKX6JgD1D83/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202505/26/37J5v1iMAA83/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202505/26/SdYeZ9yevF82/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202505/26/KK80aKpsjh83/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202505/26/bJp3T9zwcZ74/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202505/27/g3SXhzk5x585/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202505/27/6vAQwH5ZWd80/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202505/28/xPNr3qSsgJ83/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202505/28/9CcnbXH3Q485/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202505/29/0Wwy1yf2Jz83/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第11集", "url": "https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202505/29/ZmmxWtagZg85/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第12集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202505/30/CjZujzkhfx74/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第13集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202505/30/j9sCrGiWQx83/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第14集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202505/31/cruhAJkBtC74/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第1